import vocabulary.dl
import ../execution.dl
import lib/list.dl

[the website farm action operation] means: 1
[the website farm test operation] means: 2
[the website farm jump operation] means: 3
[the website farm loop operation] means: 4
[the website farm next operation] means: 5

class:
    patterns:
        website farm instruction
    members:
        operation as an integer
        identifier as an integer
        argument as an integer
        amount as an integer
        target as an integer
        area as a string
        source as website execution range
        destination as an integer
        count as an integer

class:
    patterns:
        website farm plan
    members:
        code as the type of (an empty list of website farm instruction)
        error as a string

to get an empty website farm plan:
    set result to a new website farm plan
    set result's code to an empty list of website farm instruction
    return result

to free website farm plan {a pointer to website farm plan:plan}:
    free plan's code
